# Requirement Implementation Summary

## R8: Council authorizes reserve use only in emergencies or through majority vote
This requirement is implemented through the `reserve_authorize` action which is available to council members. During a council meeting, they analyze emergency conditions and vote on whether to authorize reserve usage. The action enforces that reserves can only be used in emergencies (defined as lake stock < 200 kg, >20% of villagers short-falling, or no net catch for 3 consecutive days) or through a simple majority vote from the council.

## R9: Council releases exactly the amount needed to bring short-falling villagers to 1 unit  
